1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,420
Now I see it in the checkout line

2
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:06,812
I see it in the pew

3
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:10,500
The one who's always smiling

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,420
Might be the one who's breaking too

5
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:17,700
We trade "I'm fine" like a password

6
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:21,140
Just to make it through the door

7
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:24,820
But everybody's carrying something

8
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:28,180
They've never said before

9
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:31,940
I kept ten years of notes in my phone

10
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:35,460
All the things I couldn't say

11
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:39,380
My loved ones said to share them

12
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:42,100
So I'm giving them away
